<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>org.mutantcat.electronicpointer</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0</project_license>

  <name>电子教鞭</name>
  <name xml:lang="en">ElectronicPointer</name>
  <summary>在任何应用之上书写与批注的桌面电子教鞭</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="en">Annotate and present on top of any application</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      电子教鞭把整个屏幕变成一块可写的板：切到画笔、荧光笔或板擦，就能在幻灯片、代码和
      网页上直接标注，画错了随时撤销，讲完一段就翻到下一页。
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="en">
      ElectronicPointer turns the whole screen into a writable board. Switch to the pen, the
      highlighter or the eraser and annotate slides, code and web pages directly, undo as
      often as you like, and move on to the next page when a section is done.
    </p>
    <p>
      画面可以随时冻结成背景继续批注，工具栏和画板各自独立开关，鼠标事件可以穿过画板作用
      在背后的应用上。批注内容保存在本机,不会上传到任何地方。
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.mutantcat.electronicpointer.desktop</launchable>

